<main id="main-content" class="events-page">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT'S HAPPENING AT AVON</p><h1>Club events<br><em>and special occasions.</em></h1><p class="lead">From speech competitions and open evenings to workshops and social get-togethers, there's always something happening at Avon Toastmasters.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow blue">SAVE THE DATE</p><h2>Upcoming <em>events.</em></h2></div><p>Keep up with what's coming up at the club. Guests and friends are welcome at many of our events.</p></div>
<% if (events && events.length) { %><div class="events-grid"><% events.forEach(event => { const categoryLabels = {competition:'Speech competition','open-house':'Open house',workshop:'Workshop',social:'Club social',special:'Special event',other:'Club event'}; %><article class="event-card" id="event-<%= event.id %>">
<% if (event.imageUrl) { %><img class="event-card__image" src="<%= event.imageUrl %>" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><% } else { %><div class="event-card__image event-card__image--placeholder" aria-hidden="true"><span>AVON<br>TOASTMASTERS</span></div><% } %>
<div class="event-card__body"><span class="event-card__category"><%= categoryLabels[event.category] || 'Club event' %></span><p class="event-card__date"><%= new Date(event.date + 'T00:00:00Z').toLocaleDateString('en-NZ',{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric',timeZone:'Pacific/Auckland'}) %><% if (event.startTime) { %> · <%= event.startTime %><% if (event.endTime) { %>–<%= event.endTime %><% } %><% } %></p><h3><%= event.title %></h3><p><%= event.description %></p><p class="event-card__location"><strong>Where:</strong> <%= event.location %></p><% if (event.bookingLink) { %><a class="btn btn-blue event-card__link" href="<%= event.bookingLink %>" <%= event.bookingLink.startsWith('https://') ? 'target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"' : '' %>>Find out more <span>↗</span></a><% } %></div></article><% }) %></div><% } else { %><div class="events-empty"><span class="events-empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><h3>Nothing on the calendar just yet.</h3><p>Check back soon for upcoming Avon Toastmasters events. Our regular club meetings are still happening as usual.</p><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/meetings.html">View meeting details</a></div><% } %>
</div></section>
<% if (pastEvents && pastEvents.length) { %><section class="section tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow blue">LOOKING BACK</p><h2>Past <em>events.</em></h2></div><p>A few moments and milestones from our recent club calendar.</p></div><div class="past-events-list"><% pastEvents.forEach(event => { %><article><span><%= new Date(event.date + 'T00:00:00Z').toLocaleDateString('en-NZ',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric',timeZone:'Pacific/Auckland'}) %></span><div><h3><%= event.title %></h3><p><%= event.location %></p></div></article><% }) %></div></div></section><% } %>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap events-visit-cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOU'RE INVITED</p><h2>Come along and<br><em>be part of it.</em></h2><p>Whether you're curious about public speaking or simply want to meet the club, you're welcome to visit us for free.</p></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/visit.html">Plan your visit <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</main>